{"id":"895d3a7bab17e118","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-termination-by-reduction-order.md","title":"thm-termination-by-reduction-order","display":"thm-termination-by-reduction-order","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-termination-by-reduction-order","aliases":["56-thm-termination-by-reduction-order"],"display":"thm-termination-by-reduction-order","type":"theorem","depends_on":["[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","[[56-df-rewrite-relation]]","[[56-df-reduction-order]]","[[56-df-terminating]]"],"source_section":"6.1.3","source_pages":"183","source_ocr_blocks":[204],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"read-and-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-termination-by-reduction-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-termination-by-reduction-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-termination-by-reduction-order"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55c39f44acb2211c\" href=\"?note=55c39f44acb2211c\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-relation\">56-df-rewrite-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ea6d0d000271b1cf\" href=\"?note=ea6d0d000271b1cf\" title=\"56-df-reduction-order\">56-df-reduction-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a0c9e286170288bf\" href=\"?note=a0c9e286170288bf\" title=\"56-df-terminating\">56-df-terminating</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"6.1.3"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"183"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>204</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R\">\\(\\to_R\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"55c39f44acb2211c\" href=\"?note=55c39f44acb2211c\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-relation\">56-df-rewrite-relation</a> 的一步改写关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}\">\\(\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compatible}\">\\(\\mathrm{Compatible}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ea6d0d000271b1cf\" href=\"?note=ea6d0d000271b1cf\" title=\"56-df-reduction-order\">56-df-reduction-order</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_R)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a0c9e286170288bf\" href=\"?note=a0c9e286170288bf\" title=\"56-df-terminating\">56-df-terminating</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_R)\n\\iff\\exists\\;&gt;\\;\\subseteq T^2\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(&gt;)\\land\\mathrm{Compatible}(R,&gt;)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_R)\n\\iff\\exists\\;&gt;\\;\\subseteq T^2\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(&gt;)\\land\\mathrm{Compatible}(R,&gt;)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Proposition 6.1.3 的双向陈述。若存在兼容下降序，每个改写步都由规则实例和上下文得到，因此包含于 &gt;，不存在无限改写链。反向取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&gt;\\,=\\,\\to_R^+\">\\(&gt;\\,=\\,\\to_R^+\\)</span>；终止保证其不可反且良基，改写关系的替换和上下文封闭性传递到传递闭包。已核对原书证明及下降方向。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.1.3，印刷页 183。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本层提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-relation","status":"resolved","id":"55c39f44acb2211c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-reduction-order","status":"resolved","id":"ea6d0d000271b1cf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-reduction-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-terminating","status":"resolved","id":"a0c9e286170288bf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-terminating]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-relation","status":"resolved","id":"55c39f44acb2211c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$\\to_R$ 为 [[56-df-rewrite-relation]] 的一步改写关系。$\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}$、$\\mathrm{Compatible}$ 见 [[56-df-reduction-order]]；$\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_R)$ 见 [[56-df-terminating]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-reduction-order","status":"resolved","id":"ea6d0d000271b1cf","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$\\to_R$ 为 [[56-df-rewrite-relation]] 的一步改写关系。$\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}$、$\\mathrm{Compatible}$ 见 [[56-df-reduction-order]]；$\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_R)$ 见 [[56-df-terminating]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-terminating","status":"resolved","id":"a0c9e286170288bf","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$\\to_R$ 为 [[56-df-rewrite-relation]] 的一步改写关系。$\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}$、$\\mathrm{Compatible}$ 见 [[56-df-reduction-order]]；$\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_R)$ 见 [[56-df-terminating]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\to_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compatible}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_R)\n\\iff\\exists\\;>\\;\\subseteq T^2\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(>)\\land\\mathrm{Compatible}(R,>)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":">\\,=\\,\\to_R^+","display":false}],"bytes":1579,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-222","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-termination-by-reduction-order.md]]"},{"id":"1a2313edea993f6b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$、$\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$。载体存在量词在集合论元语言中遍历非空集合 $A$，运算族 $I$ 遍历 $\\prod_{f\\in F}A^{A^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}}$，关系 $Q$ 遍历 $\\mathcal P(A^2)$；[[56-df-interpretation-order]] 的诱导解释关系只在这些合格代数参数上求值。解释序与归约序、终止性的接口分别采用 [[56-thm-interpretation-order-reduction-order]] 与 [[56-thm-termination-by-reduction-order]]。"},{"id":"2735feec3db7f175","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"910eea2993769cc6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["a6c29a8d098ef0ed","55c39f44acb2211c","ea6d0d000271b1cf","a0c9e286170288bf"]}